WEBVTT

00:00:00.145 --> 00:00:02.720
At 7:42, a customer calls.

00:00:02.845 --> 00:00:03.840
The shop is closed.

00:00:04.165 --> 00:00:06.100
The phone rings. Nobody
answers.

00:00:07.045 --> 00:00:09.060
ZeroHand catches that call.

00:00:09.425 --> 00:00:10.960
It texts the customer back,

00:00:11.145 --> 00:00:12.320
asks what they need,

00:00:12.405 --> 00:00:13.900
and helps get the job booked.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.620
Estimate follow-up stays within

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:17.895
the rules you approve.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:20.500
And every Monday, one receipt
shows

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.375
the replies, bookings,

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.275
and anything that still needs
you.

00:00:24.995 --> 00:00:25.975
Grow the shop.

00:00:25.995 --> 00:00:26.975
Not the back office.

00:00:26.995 --> 00:00:28.470
ZeroHand Labs.
